stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB

    [*] --> RESETTING: startup / clear outputs and transient state
    RESETTING --> INITIALIZING: startup reset complete
    RESETTING --> IDLE: runtime reset complete / preserved state valid
    INITIALIZING --> IDLE: config and repository valid
    INITIALIZING --> INITIALIZING: initialization invalid / all inactive
    IDLE --> VALIDATING: request / snapshot and service watchdog
    VALIDATING --> IDLE: invalid / log error
    VALIDATING --> LOOKUP: valid frame / retain decoded key
    LOOKUP --> IDLE: unknown or disabled / log denial
    LOOKUP --> AUTHORIZING: known enabled credential
    AUTHORIZING --> IDLE: invalid or unauthorized floor / log outcome
    AUTHORIZING --> OUTPUT_ACTIVE: grant event appended / activate one output
    AUTHORIZING --> IDLE: grant event append failure / logging_error
    OUTPUT_ACTIVE --> OUTPUT_ACTIVE: new request / controller_busy, preserve expiry
    OUTPUT_ACTIVE --> IDLE: timeout / clear output
    RESETTING --> RESETTING: manual or watchdog reset
    INITIALIZING --> RESETTING: manual or watchdog reset
    IDLE --> RESETTING: manual or watchdog reset
    VALIDATING --> RESETTING: manual or watchdog reset
    LOOKUP --> RESETTING: manual or watchdog reset
    AUTHORIZING --> RESETTING: manual or watchdog reset
    OUTPUT_ACTIVE --> RESETTING: manual or watchdog reset

    note right of IDLE: All outputs are inactive in IDLE

    classDef fault fill:#F4DEDE,stroke:#A44A4A,color:#572727,stroke-width:2px;
    classDef external fill:#E8EEF3,stroke:#607D8B,color:#1F2933,stroke-width:1.5px;
    classDef controller fill:#274C77,stroke:#16324F,color:#FFFFFF,stroke-width:2px,font-weight:600;
    classDef data fill:#D9F0EE,stroke:#2F7F7B,color:#183A3A,stroke-width:1.5px;
    classDef decision fill:#F5E8C8,stroke:#B7791F,color:#4B3512,stroke-width:2px;

    class RESETTING fault
    class INITIALIZING external
    class IDLE controller
    class VALIDATING,LOOKUP,AUTHORIZING data
    class OUTPUT_ACTIVE decision
